msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:577
msgid "Edit & save"
msgstr "编辑并保存"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:577
msgid "Create inside"
msgstr "在其中创建"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:577
msgid "Upload into"
msgstr "上传到其中"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:581
msgid "Role"
msgstr "角色"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:582
msgid "Path to test"
msgstr "要测试的路径"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:587
msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "正在检查…"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:592
msgid "This role has no access at all (access is switched off)."
msgstr "此角色没有任何访问权限（访问已关闭）。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:595
msgid "file"
msgstr "文件"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:595
msgid "folder"
msgstr "文件夹"

#. translators: %s: detected file types
#: assets/js/access-rules.js:598
msgid "detected as: %s"
msgstr "识别为：%s"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:602
msgid "Allowed"
msgstr "允许"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:611
msgid "Test access"
msgstr "测试访问"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:612
msgid "Check what a role could do with a file or folder — using the rules on this screen, even before you save them."
msgstr "检查某个角色可以对文件或文件夹执行哪些操作。使用此页面上的规则，保存之前即可测试。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:616
msgid "Test"
msgstr "测试"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:631
msgid "Enter a number of days between 1 and 3650."
msgstr "请输入 1 到 3650 之间的天数。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:638
msgid "days"
msgstr "天"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:649
msgid "Deleted files and folders can be kept for a while so they can be restored. There are two levels, and each can be switched on separately."
msgstr "已删除的文件和文件夹可以保留一段时间，以便恢复。共有两个层级，每个层级可以单独启用。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:653
msgid "Personal trash"
msgstr "个人回收站"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:655
msgid "Give every user their own trash"
msgstr "为每个用户提供自己的回收站"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:656
msgid "Each user’s deletions go to their own Trash, where they can restore them, remove them or empty it. They only ever see their own items."
msgstr "每个用户删除的项目都会进入其自己的回收站，用户可以在其中恢复、移除项目或清空回收站。用户只能看到自己的项目。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:657
msgid "Keep items in a user’s trash for"
msgstr "用户回收站中项目的保留时间"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:659 assets/js/file-browser.js:214 assets/js/file-browser.js:1971
msgid "Site trash"
msgstr "站点回收站"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:661
msgid "Keep every deletion in the site trash"
msgstr "将所有删除的项目保留在站点回收站中"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:662
msgid "A safety net for administrators: everything any user deletes is kept here, even after they empty their own trash. Only administrators can see it, restore from it or empty it."
msgstr "为管理员提供的安全保障：任何用户删除的所有内容都会保留在这里，即使用户清空了自己的回收站也是如此。只有管理员可以查看、从中恢复或清空它。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:663
msgid "Keep items in the site trash for"
msgstr "站点回收站中项目的保留时间"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:669
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "推荐"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:672 assets/js/access-rules.js:674
msgid "Permanent deletion"
msgstr "永久删除"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:673
msgid "Who may delete an item for good before the site trash’s retention period is over."
msgstr "谁可以在站点回收站的保留期结束之前永久删除项目。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:675
msgid "Administrators only"
msgstr "仅限管理员"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:676
msgid "Users can remove items from their own trash, but the site trash keeps its copy until it expires."
msgstr "用户可以从自己的回收站中移除项目，但站点回收站会保留其副本，直到过期。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:677
msgid "Also the user who deleted the item"
msgstr "删除该项目的用户也可以"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:678
msgid "In their own trash, a user can right-click an item and choose “Permanently delete”, which also removes it from the site trash. They can never empty the site trash."
msgstr "在自己的回收站中，用户可以右键单击项目并选择“永久删除”，这也会将其从站点回收站中移除。用户永远无法清空站点回收站。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:679
msgid "Requires the personal trash: users can only reach this option from their own trash."
msgstr "需要启用个人回收站：用户只能在自己的回收站中使用此选项。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:683
msgid "Stored in:"
msgstr "存储位置："

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:684
msgid "The trash folder is created on the first deletion."
msgstr "回收站文件夹会在首次删除时创建。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:686
msgid "Outside the public web root: the web server cannot serve these files."
msgstr "位于公共 Web 根目录之外：Web 服务器无法提供这些文件。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:687
msgid "Inside the web root, protected by deny rules (.htaccess / web.config), a random folder name, random item names and private file permissions. On nginx, add a rule denying access to this folder, or define CLOVERBROWSER_TRASH_DIR in wp-config.php as a folder outside the web root."
msgstr "位于 Web 根目录之内，通过拒绝规则（.htaccess / web.config）、随机文件夹名称、随机项目名称和私有文件权限加以保护。如使用 nginx，请添加一条拒绝访问此文件夹的规则，或在 wp-config.php 中将 CLOVERBROWSER_TRASH_DIR 定义为 Web 根目录之外的文件夹。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:688
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "存储"

#. translators: 1: number of items, 2: total size
#: assets/js/access-rules.js:692
msgid "The site currently holds %1$s trashed item (%2$s)."
msgid_plural "The site currently holds %1$s trashed items (%2$s)."
msgstr[0] "站点当前共有 %1$s 个已删除的项目（%2$s）。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:694
msgid "Retention changes also apply to items already in the trash: items outside the new periods are deleted at the next hourly cleanup."
msgstr "保留期更改也适用于已在回收站中的项目：超出新保留期的项目将在下一次每小时清理时被删除。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:696
msgid "Open site trash"
msgstr "打开站点回收站"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:707
msgid "Both trashes are off: every deletion is permanent and cannot be undone."
msgstr "两个回收站均已关闭：所有删除都是永久性的，无法撤销。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:709
msgid "Without the site trash, an item is gone for good as soon as its owner removes it from their trash."
msgstr "如果没有站点回收站，项目一旦被其所有者从回收站中移除，就会被永久删除。"

#: assets/js/access-rules.js:712
msgid "Users can permanently delete their own items, so the site trash is no longer a complete record of deletions."
msgstr "用户可以永久删除自己的项目，因此站点回收站不再是删除操作的完整记录。"

